workspaces.keyboard = Ikhibhodi: Alt+↑/↓ ikhetha ukuhlelwa. Ctrl/Cmd+N ihlela igama lalo; +S ilondoloza ikhophi; +Enter iyakusebenzisa; +U iyakubuyekeza; +R ikuqamba kabusha; +D iyakususa; +0 ikubuyisela esimweni sokuqala.
